# Settings for the SIFT IVF runs only. The IVF steps pass this file after p1-common.
# The probes=all point reads all 1024 lists. With a filter, each query group at this point
# takes minutes. Thus the point takes hours at full size.
# The exact run of the group measures the full scan, so the IVF sweep stops at 64 probes.
# The default probe count stays in the sweep.
# The run comparison ignores the IVF sweep settings, so the IVF run still compares with the
# exact and HNSW runs.
-Dquery.ivf.probe.values=1,4,16,64
